{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soap Slide is a party game played on physics\u2011based tracks, playable solo or with friends. Speed, angle and fluid interactions are at the core: find the right move, slide your soap and climb the leaderboards. Key themes: physics\u2011based gameplay, multiplayer experience and leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/d1374c06c677b503d46ed8142dc05dab.poster.avif?t=1772784405\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/d1374c06c677b503d46ed8142dc05dab.webm?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/d1374c06c677b503d46ed8142dc05dab.mp4?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1772784405\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slippery Physics Chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate, bounce and collide with soap characters; comical wipeouts and unexpected outcomes make every run fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/5d5be374e292c1fda666d061310bd275.poster.avif?t=1772784405\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/5d5be374e292c1fda666d061310bd275.webm?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/5d5be374e292c1fda666d061310bd275.mp4?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini Games &amp; Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soap Slide offers special modes so every session feels like a different experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/e1f63f9f7d3b6e21d8a95f6e9fdcb690.poster.avif?t=1772784405\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/e1f63f9f7d3b6e21d8a95f6e9fdcb690.webm?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/e1f63f9f7d3b6e21d8a95f6e9fdcb690.mp4?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single or Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full chaos with friends: slide together, collide and whoever slips the most wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/4485d746bd51d2c2196be160b22f381f.poster.avif?t=1772784405\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/4485d746bd51d2c2196be160b22f381f.webm?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/4485d746bd51d2c2196be160b22f381f.mp4?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Deep Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are easy to pick up; mastering the game requires discovering the right angle and speed combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/9576d74407e5ab00655b8bf8c415ffc1.poster.avif?t=1772784405\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/9576d74407e5ab00655b8bf8c415ffc1.webm?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/9576d74407e5ab00655b8bf8c415ffc1.mp4?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your soap: show off your style with colorful skins, patterns and silly effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/c665b9a6e2ac6bc70e51d25ea0b80e75.poster.avif?t=1772784405\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/c665b9a6e2ac6bc70e51d25ea0b80e75.webm?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/c665b9a6e2ac6bc70e51d25ea0b80e75.mp4?t=1772784405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social</strong></p><p class=\"bb_p